      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This camera issue breaks immersion and makes the camera completely unusable in many instances. If this is \"working as intended\" then I don't see the logic behind this change in camera behavior at all, unless its a bug (then it should be addressed) because camera viewpoints don't magically leave people's grip and fly through the fabric of 3d-space to clip through the holder's body in real life under any circumstances.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
